# The secrets lane's controls are .env files ON PURPOSE. The positive control must be a
# tracked credential file, because "tracked" is half of what the rule tests, and the ignore
# rule above would otherwise make the control silent and the lane untested. These two paths
# carry invented values and nothing else.
!packs/config/security/commodity/controls/positive/committed/.env
!packs/config/security/commodity/controls/negative/templated/.env
.DS_Store
